<title>USA: Delta Air Lines hires Saatchi &amp; Saatchi.</title>
<headline>Delta Air Lines hires Saatchi &amp; Saatchi.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines Inc said Thursday it had hired Cordiant Plc's Saatchi &amp; Saatchi unit as the advertising agency for its $100 million account, effective immediately.</p>
<p>&quot;We chose Saatchi &amp; Saatchi because they are a worldwide agency with a proven track record for building global brands,&quot; Robert Coggin, executive vice-president of marketing for Delta, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
